Hi, it's thinkit, the "hexadecimal" guy. Well lots has changed here. 
I'm not all about hexadecimal anymore by far. I've been thinking 
much more about the singularity and transhumanism. Lojban has a real 
place here. If one somehow makes a computer sentient, what language 
would the computer use? Lojban is a great start. Vocalization would 
be optional, so some machine code compiled lojban would be the 
machine's native language.





